# ...but NOT the diagnostic SOURCE. `main/critic*` is meant for the result
# dirs and JSON above; it was also swallowing critic_diagnostics.py and
# critic_ceiling.py, so the whole diagnostic suite sat outside version control.
!main/critic*.py
# Same trap for `main/minimax*`, which was added for the minimax_phase0_* run
# dirs but also matches minimax_axis_diag.py, minimax_noop_decomp.py etc. Those
# happen to be safe ONLY because they were already tracked before the rule
# existed -- a NEW minimax_*.py would be silently invisible.
!main/minimax*.py
main/*json
